<div class="non-drawer" data-non-cart-drawer hidden>
  <div class="non-drawer__scrim" data-non-cart-close style="position:absolute;inset:0"></div>

  <aside
    class="non-drawer__panel"
    role="dialog"
    aria-modal="true"
    aria-label="{{ 'cart.general.title' | t }}">
    <header class="non-drawer__head">
      <span class="non-mono non-eyebrow">{{ 'cart.general.title' | t }}</span>
      <button
        type="button"
        class="non-header__cart"
        data-non-cart-close
        aria-label="{{ 'general.accessibility.close' | t }}">
        Close
      </button>
    </header>

    <div class="non-drawer__items" data-non-cart-items>
      <p class="non-drawer__empty">{{ 'cart.general.empty' | t }}</p>
    </div>

    <footer class="non-drawer__foot">
      {%- comment -%}
        A won NON Lotto prize, carried through to where it gets used. The code
        is issued in a modal that is dismissed long before checkout, so without
        this the customer has to remember it or go digging through their inbox.

        Applying it is a link to /discount/CODE, which is Shopify's own
        mechanism: it puts the code on the session and redirects back, so the
        discount is real and validated by Shopify rather than displayed by us.
        Populated by cart.js from localStorage — deliberately not Liquid, since
        the prize belongs to the browser that won it, not the page cache.
      {%- endcomment -%}
      <div class="non-cart-prize" data-non-cart-prize hidden>
        <div class="non-cart-prize__body">
          <span class="non-mono non-eyebrow">{{ 'cart.prize.won' | t }}</span>
          <strong class="non-cart-prize__desc" data-non-cart-prize-desc></strong>
          <span class="non-cart-prize__code" data-non-cart-prize-code></span>
        </div>
        <a class="non-cart-prize__apply" data-non-cart-prize-apply href="#">
          {{ 'cart.prize.apply' | t }}
        </a>
      </div>

      <p class="non-mono non-eyebrow" data-non-cart-shipping hidden></p>

      <div style="display:flex;align-items:baseline;justify-content:space-between;margin:8px 0 14px">
        <span class="non-mono non-eyebrow">{{ 'cart.general.subtotal' | t }}</span>
        <strong data-non-cart-subtotal style="font-size:17px">{{ 0 | money }}</strong>
      </div>

      <form action="{{ routes.cart_url }}" method="post">
        <button type="submit" name="checkout" class="non-atc" style="margin-top:0" data-non-cart-checkout disabled>
          {{ 'cart.general.checkout' | t }}
        </button>
      </form>

      <p class="non-mono non-eyebrow" style="margin-top:12px;letter-spacing:.12em">
        {{ 'cart.general.taxes_and_shipping' | t }}
      </p>
    </footer>
  </aside>
</div>
